{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o200b","title":"曹操遗令简葬不离军职","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o200b-account","label":"正文","text":"遗令葬毕除服，屯戍将士不得离部，官吏各司职；以时服入殓，不藏金玉珍宝。","evidence":["wudi-e-o200b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"留遗令","evidence":["wudi-e-o200b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"临终遗令","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据所在段落机械补定年份。","evidence":["wudi-e-o200b-q"]},"source_order":[1,1121,"O200b"],"order":445}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o200b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-3971bfd8e9cb605255dc","layer":"original","quote":"遗令曰：“天下尚未安定，未得遵古也。葬毕，皆除服〖4〗；其将兵屯戍者，皆不得离屯部；有司各率乃职。殓以时服〖5〗，无藏金玉珍宝。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":445,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":23,"end":87,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
